# Runs registry. One run per line, six columns, separated by spaces or tabs.
# Lines starting with # and blank lines are ignored.
#
#   name   machine   dir   method   tmux   note
#
# name     Anything, as long as it's unique. exp status / log / start all use it.
# machine  A hostname ssh can reach. Write local to run on this machine, skipping ssh.
# dir      Point at the individual run. If one SFT experiment has both smoke/ and
#          formal/ under it, write formal/, or the records from the two runs get
#          mixed together. Relative paths resolve against this file's directory.
# method   Decides which script reads progress: it looks for
#          progress/<the part of method before the ->.py.
#          awm-hps looks for progress/awm.py. With no match it falls back to
#          progress/generic.py, so sft, dpo and diffusionnft work with no code.
# tmux     Write - to say exp start/stop doesn't manage this run (someone else
#          started it, or it has already finished).
# note     Anything. Last field, so it may contain spaces.

# name             machine  dir                    method   tmux   note
demo-sft          local   ./examples/demo-sft    sft       -      example: runs locally, no cluster needed
